<title>DENMARK: Landwirtschafliche Rentebank sets 250 mln dkk bond.</title>
<headline>Landwirtschafliche Rentebank sets 250 mln dkk bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond issue was announced on Tuesday by the borrower, Landwirtschafliche Rentebank, Frankfurt am Main.</p>
<p> AMT   250 million DKK    COUPON     4.0	 MATURITY   29.Nov.99</p>
<p> TYPE  fixed	    ISS PRICE  not known</p>
<p> PAY FREQ   annual on 29.Nov</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
</text>
